Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:38.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（理查德 德克萨斯州 两个月前）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:38.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（35号州际公路 现在）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:30.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科林郡公共图书馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽快把你弟弟带出屋去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸出去猎鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且已经好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dad's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为他希望我们继续他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎杀恶鬼 拯救人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要找到爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是我最想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 还有多远？这儿真冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, is it much further? I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该就在附近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be just up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你究竟是怎么找到这个地方的 瑟斯顿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find this place anyway, Thurston?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我表妹告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cousin told me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是绝对不会进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am so not going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wusses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们好不容易过来一趟 至少也得进去看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came all the way here, might as well check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 就逛一下然后马上回车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just hurry this up and get back to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里实在很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freaking cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想握着我的手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to hold your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有其他部位也想交给我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any other parts I can hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 算了吧 你想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew. Shut up, you loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是些什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说它们徘徊在地窖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that it lives in the root cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}专门攻击女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes after girls. Always girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她们吊死在房椽上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just strings them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说？他们是指谁？你是从哪知道这些鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They say"? Who's "they"?Where did you hear this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说了 我表妹告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l told you, my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么她从哪里听到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where did she hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 就是知道了呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. She just heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了 把手电给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. Give me that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 看吧 邪恶的地窖\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, look, it's the evil root cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保存罐头的地方 里面总是蔬菜之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, where Satan cans all his vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不如你们自己下来看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get your candy asses down here and see for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是个普通的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a basement full.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摆着些瓶瓶罐罐 显然是某个废农场的地窖\N{\fnArial\fs30}of skank-filled jars in some crap farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没见到什么恐怖的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起因不明的火灾带走了我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fire of unknown origin took my baby away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈啊 很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha. Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想把你打扮得更像你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot of scenery here in east Texas. Kind of gotta make your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 我们都不是小孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we're not kids anymore, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能再玩那些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna start that crap up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪些事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start what up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶作剧 那总是很愚蠢 而且每次都一发不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}That prank stuff.It's stupid and it always escalates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你有什么问题 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还怕我会把只小水獭放进你的洗发水里 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You afraid you're gonna get a little Nair in your shampoo again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行啊 这次可是你要玩的 别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just remember, you started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 尽管放马过来 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on, baldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这是在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离理查德森还有两小时车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few hours outside of Richardson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再给我说说那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the lowdown again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一群孩子去了当地一幢闹鬼的屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}kids go poking around this local haunted house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 闹什么鬼？- 显然是个十分凶恶的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haunted by what? - Apparently, a pretty misogynistic spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传说它袭击女孩 并把她们吊上房椽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend goes, it takes girlsand strings them up in the rafters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何 这群孩子看到一个女孩吊死在地窖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}These kids see this dead girlhanging in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有人认出受害者了吗？- 问题就在这 当警察到达的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anybody ID the corpse? - Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当警察到达那里 尸体不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time the cops got there, the body was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以警察认为那些孩子耍了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops are saying the kids were yanking chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the cops are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 但我读了那些孩子的第一手陈述\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but I read a couple of the kids' firsthand accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 描述得很真切 - 你在哪读到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They seem sincere. - Where did you read these accounts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我们会经过德州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew we'd be passing through Texas…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以昨天晚上 我浏览了当地的灵异事件网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}so last night, I surfed some local paranormal websites.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 找到了这么一个网站 - 是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I found one. - And what's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hellhoundslair.com（此网站真实存在）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhoundslair.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我猜猜 母亲的地窖不停有水流出？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.Streaming live out of Mom's basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 差不多 - 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, probably. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 那些经营网站的人 即使被鬼咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of those websites wouldn't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不明白究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}a ghost if it bit them in the "persqueeter."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:06:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 就这么让爸爸走了 显然是一个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we let Dad take off, which was a mistake, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们根本不知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们需要找些事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meantime, we gotta find something to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去查一下这件事显然没有害处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No harm checking this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那我们去哪找那些孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where do we find these kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种城市里年青人通常会去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same place you always find kids in a town like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我生平见到的最可怕的事 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the scariest thing I ever saw, I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一踏进那里 就看到墙壁上刷的符号 黑色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the moment we walked in.The walls were painted black.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 红色的 - 我觉得那是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Red. - I think it was blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可怕的符号 - 十字型\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All these freaky symbols. - Crosses and stars, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 星型 - 五角星\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pentagons. - Pentecostals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总之 我一直提心吊胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever, I had my eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我可以绝对保证 无论别人说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you this much No matter what anybody says-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那个可怜的女孩 - 黑衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That poor girl. - With the black…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 绿眼睛 - 红头发 就吊在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blonde. - Red hair, just hanging there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 在半空中 - 一动不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kicking. - Without even moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是真的 - 百分百真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was real. - It's 100 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还挺漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kind of hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 当然 除了死亡那一部分 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you know, in a dead sort of way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们怎么找到那个地方的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did you find out about this place, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克雷格 - 克雷格带我们去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Craig. - Craig took us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 能为你们效劳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas. Help you with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是克雷格·瑟斯顿？- 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, are you Craig Thurston? - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是「达拉斯晨报」的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're reporters with The Dallas Morning News.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我是迪恩 这位是萨姆 - 没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm Dean, this is Sam. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真巧 我也是个写手 为学校的文学杂志写文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'm a writer too.I write for my school's lit. magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good for you, Morrissey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正在写一篇关于本地灵异事件的文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we're doing an article on local hauntings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说你知道一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor has it you might know about one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是说鬼屋？- 就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean the Hell House? - That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道该从何说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think there was anything to the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我们说说那个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell us the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 假设 在30年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, supposedly, back in the '30s…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个叫默德凯·默多克农场主\N{\fnArial\fs30}this farmer, Mordechai Murdock,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他的六个女儿住在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he used to live in the house with his six daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在经济大萧条时期 他的作物没有收成\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was during the Depression, his crops were failing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没钱养活自己的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}he didn't have enough money to feed his children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜事情就这样发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess that's when he went off the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么发生的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜 他认为让女儿们痛快地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he figured it was best if his girls died quick…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比慢慢饿死要强\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他攻击她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he attacked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们尖叫 企求他停止 但他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they screamed, begged for him to stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把她们一个一个吊死\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he just strung them up, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当一切都结束 他最后上吊自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when it was all finished, he turned around and hung himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人说从此以后那些鬼魂就被困在那幢房子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they say that his spirit is trapped in the house forever…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吊死任何一个走进去的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}stringing up any other girl that goes inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从哪听说这些的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where did you hear all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的表妹戴娜告诉我的 我不知道她从哪听来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cousin Dana told me.I don't know where she heard it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 我从没相信过那回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta realize, I didn't believe this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在你信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我不明白那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell to think, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了 这些话我对警察也是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, l'll tell you exactly what I told the police, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女孩是真的 她死了 这不是什么恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl was real, and she was dead.This was not a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓我再也不想接近那幢房子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I don't wanna go anywhere near that house…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远不\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我得说 我相信那个孩子 - 很多事有待调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't say I blame the kid. - Yeah, so much for curb appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没有 EMF不能用 - 怎么会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but the EMF's no good. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜是那些东西干扰了信号 这是所有的读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that thing's still got a little juice in it. It's screwing with all the readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that would do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来老默多克生前是个恶魔崇拜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like old man Murdock was a bit of a tagger during his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死后也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after his time too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒十字被用于恶魔崇拜已经有几世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reverse cross has been used by Satanists for centuries…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但硫磺印记直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this Sigil of Sulfur didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}60年代才首次在旧金山出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}in San Francisco until the '60s.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难怪你总是不得安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly why you never get laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个呢 你有见过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about this one?You seen this one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但想不起在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是喷漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:11:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还是新喷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems pretty fresh too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不太清楚 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我俩从不相信官方的结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I hate to agree with authority figures of any kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我认为这次他们可能是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the cops might be right about this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天 原来是两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut. Just a couple of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们来这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们才是来这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们属于这里 我们是职业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong here. We're professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 职业干什么的？- 灵异事件调查者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professional what? - Paranormal investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个 好好看看 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Take a look at that, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 艾德·瑟德莫尔和哈利·斯潘格勒。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Zeddmore and Harry Spangler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hellhoundslair.com 那网站是你们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhoundslair.com. You guys run that website?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是啊 - 喔 耶 我们可是那的忠实粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Oh, yeah, yeah. We're huge fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你们是干吗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know who you guys are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是吗 - 业余人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了单纯的刺激 搜寻鬼魂 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for ghosts and cheap thrills. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 如果你们不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you guys don't mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正要开始严肃的科学调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're trying to conduct a seriousscientific investigation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你们发现什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What do you got so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈利 不如你和他们说说EMF？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, why don't you tell them about EMF?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}EMF？\N{\fnArial\fs30}EMF?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电磁场探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electromagnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼怪会引起能量的异常波动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spectral entities can cause energy fluctuations…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种信号可以用EMF探测到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can be read with an EMF detector…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该就是这附近的波段\N{\fnArial\fs30}like this bad boy right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喔 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是2.8毫克 - 二点八\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's 2.8 MG. - Two point eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里很热\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们以前有见过真实的鬼魂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. So have you guys ever really seen a ghost before, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once. We were…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在调查一幢旧房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were investigating this old house…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:12:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我们看到一只花瓶从桌上摔了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we saw a vase fall right off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 自己摔下来的 - 我们… 也许… 没有亲眼见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By itself. - We didn't actually see it…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们听到了 一旦经历过那种事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we heard it, and something like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你的一生就会改变 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …it changes you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I get the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看我们俩该走了 让他们继续工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go, let them get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 你们是该走了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you should. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我们通常用笑声开始工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. That pot we smoked gave me the giggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 - 嗨 查到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没查到有默德凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't find a Mordechai…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我确实找到一个叫莫得·默多克的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I did turn up a Martin Murdockwho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}30年代住在那幢房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}lived in that house in the '30s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的确有孩子 但只有两个 都是男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did have children, but only two of them, both boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且也没有记录显示他杀害了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no record he ever killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你查到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然那些孩子给出了女孩的详细外貌描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids didn't give a clear description of that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我去警察局查的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did hit up the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现相符的失踪人口报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matching missing persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像这个女孩从来不曾存在一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like she never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了 Sam 我们查过了 这整件事是个恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, come on. We did our digging.This one's a bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些孩子捏造了所有故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know, those Hellhound boys made up the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好吧 - 我说不如我们找个小酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, all right. - I say we find ourselves a bar…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃点喝点 让传说见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some beers and leave the legend to the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这到底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你的把戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you got? It's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真够逊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is bush league.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有去无回的地方 - 为什么我非得去那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The point of no return. - Why do I have to go in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉尔因为你选择冒险而不是说真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, Jill, you chose dare instead of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以要么你去莫迪凯的地窖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either have to grab a jar from Mordechai's cellar…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿个罐头回来 或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring it back, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者你和我约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can make out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了 我宁愿去鬼屋一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the homicidal ghost, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你相信里面会死人吗？- 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you ever take that dare? - Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on one second, Mr. Goodwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生看什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察说那个女孩在里面上吊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops say that poor girl hung herself in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 自杀？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Suicide? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个成绩全A的优秀学生 前途无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was a straight-A student with a full ride to UT too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just don't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们忽略了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe we missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜警察们不想让任何人进入那幢房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops don't want any more kids screwing around in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还是得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we still gotta get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你会找谁？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you gonna call?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 快 - 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 停下 - 快跑 不要离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Come on, don't leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定见过这个符号 但就是想不起来 真要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have I seen that symbol? It's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 我们没多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 萨姆 我猜你愿意尝尝这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam, I dare you to take a swig of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会这样做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell would I do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你喜欢的牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I double dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恨老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你宁愿是个鬼魂？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd rather it was a ghost? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么鬼魂 盐块竟然不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of spirit is immune to rock salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 也许我们该离开 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we should just go. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想约翰·爱德华会离开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would John Edward go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们甩掉了警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we've lost the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在让我们静下心来 全力工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find our center and get some work done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吗？好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? All right, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那该死的鬼魂出乎我的意料 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get that damn thing out of my face. - Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的上帝… 是个环。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Lord…Of the Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.01,0:21:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个人刚才还…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's a-Look.There's a man over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他去哪里了？- 好了 小伙子们 跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw… Where'd he go? - Boys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.95,0:22:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死 这到底是什么符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this symbol?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是烦死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bugging the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个调查过程真是要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole damn job's bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是说默德凯只攻击女孩子嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the legend said that Mordechai only goes after chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt does. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他攻击你还情有可原 但为什么也攻击我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That explains why he went after you.But why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传说他是上吊自杀的 但你看到他那断裂的手腕了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend also says he hung himself.But you see those slit wrists?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.97,0:22:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 恩 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the ax too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼魂通常是有固定行事模式的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts are usually pretty strict, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.97,0:22:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次应该都是一样的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Following the same patterns over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么这个的行为模式会不断改变 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But this mook keeps changing.|- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 故事是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, the way the story goes…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.48,0:22:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人在网上发了个新贴 听听这段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone added a new posting to the Hellhound site. Listen to this:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.65,0:22:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说莫德凯是个拿着斧子砍人的恶魔崇拜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They say Mordechai Murdock was really a Satanist…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到他的手腕断了为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}who chopped up his victims with an ax before slitting his own wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此他被永远禁锢在那所房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's imprisoned in the house for eternity."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.62,0:23:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这究竟是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is this going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我刚知道这一切是从哪开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I might havejust figured out where it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.03,0:23:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 克雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Craig.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我真的没什么心情回答你们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, l'm really not in the mood to answer any more of your questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 没事 我们买完东西就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry. Don't worry. We're just here to buy an album, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 我实在想不出那个符号代表什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I couldn't figure out what that symbol was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.97,0:23:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来我突然发现 其实那个符号一点意义也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I realized it doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不过是Blue Oyster Cult（老牌摇滚乐队）的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the logo for Blue yster Cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:24:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我克雷格 你是喜欢BOC\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Craig. You into BOC?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是想把人们吓得屁滚尿流？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just scaring the hell out of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你告诉我那幢房子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you tell us about that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.53,0:24:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次不要说没谱的谎话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without lying through your ass this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的表妹戴娜正好放假从TCU回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cousin Dana was on break from TCU.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.67,0:24:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜我们只是有点无聊 想找些事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we were just bored, looking for something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正好我知道那有个废弃的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I showed her this abandoned dump I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.59,0:24:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想如果把那里布置成好像闹鬼的样子 一定很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it'd be funny if we made it look like it was haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.84,0:24:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是我们在墙上画了些符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we painted symbols on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.76,0:24:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些来自唱片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some from some albums.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些来自戴娜的意识形态课本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some from some of Dana's theology textbooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来我们发现有个默多克曾住在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we found out this guy, Murdock, used to live there…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.06,0:24:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以就顺势编了那个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we made up some story to go along with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就一传十 十传百\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they told people who told other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.40,0:24:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有两个人把这些搬上了那个愚蠢的网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then these two guys put it on their stupid website.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的一下子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything just…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.74,0:25:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就变成真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}took on a life of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.12,0:25:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最初只是觉得好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I thought it was funny at first, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.25,0:25:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在 我真不知道该怎么承受这种结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that girl's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不过是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.09,0:25:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些传说都是假的 全是我们自编自导自演\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I mean, none of it was real. We made the whole thing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.51,0:25:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.56,0:25:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.15,0:25:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这些都不是真的 那怎么解释莫德凯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If none of it was real, how the hell do you explain Mordechai?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.92,0:25:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.55,0:25:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 你去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.59,0:25:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出去了一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.59,0:26:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想了个能够解释莫德凯存在的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think I might have a theory about what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.64,0:26:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是什么？- 说不定莫德凯是个Tulpa\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah, what if Mordechai is a tulpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.93,0:26:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- Tulpa？- 对 一种源自西藏的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tulpa? - Yeah, a Tibetan Thought-form.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道Tulpa是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I know what a tulpa is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是穿上衣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why don't you get dressed.I wanna go grab something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.99,0:26:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要用一下洗手间 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go, gents. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.62,0:26:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.21,0:26:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没事 - 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. l'm fine. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.29,0:26:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 继续说 关于Tulpa\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so keep going.What about these tulpas?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}50年代的时候 在西藏有一次意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so there was this incident in Tibet in 1915.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.97,0:26:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一群僧侣在脑海里想象假人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Group of monks visualize a golem in their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.47,0:26:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他们冥想得太厉害 所以那东西真的变活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They meditate on it so hard, they bring the thing to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.81,0:26:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就这么凭空被创造了出来 - 所以？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out of thin air. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.48,0:26:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不过是20个僧侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was 20 monks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想象一下千万个网民能创造出什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what 10, 000 web surfers could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.36,0:26:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想说的是 克雷格编了这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Craig starts the story about Mordechai…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后故事上了网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it spreads, goes online.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.65,0:26:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在成千上万的人都确信这个混蛋的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now countless people believe in the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.15,0:27:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're trying to tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.86,0:27:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就因为人们相信莫德凯存在 所以他存在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that just because people believe in Mordechai, he's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.83,0:27:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们也相信圣诞老人 我怎么从没在圣诞节看到过他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}People believe in Santa Claus. How come I'm not hooked up every Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一 你不是什么好人 第二 你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a bad person.And because of this:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.92,0:27:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是西藏的灵魂印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Tibetan spirit sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.05,0:27:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就画在墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the wall of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.05,0:27:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Craig说他们照着意识形态的课本画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Craig said they were painting from a textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.35,0:27:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜他们甚至不知道那些符号的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet they painted this not even knowing what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个印记已经沿用了几世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sigil has been used for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它像放大镜一样聚集冥想思维的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrating meditative thoughts like a magnifying glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.85,0:27:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以上Hellhoundslair的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are on the Hellhound's website…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.90,0:27:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整天盯着这个印记 想着莫德凯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}staring at the symbol, thinking about Mordechai…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.73,0:27:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不太清楚 但很可能会创造出莫德凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't know, but it might be enough to bring aatulpa to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那同时解释了为什么莫德凯的行为模式会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would explain why he keeps changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.36,0:27:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 当传说改变 人们的想法也会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. As the legend changes, people think different things…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.53,0:27:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以莫德凯也随之改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Mordechai himself changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像电话游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a game of Telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.91,0:27:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且那也解释了为什么盐块对它不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would also explain why rock salt didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那不是传统意义上的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's not a traditional spirit, per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.54,0:27:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 那么我们把印记擦掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Okay. So why don't we just…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.38,0:27:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让故事下网\N{\fnArial\fs30}get this spirit-sigil thingy off the wall and the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.42,0:27:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 没有那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦Tulpa被创造出来 它们就能独立存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, once tulpas are created, they take on a life of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了 如果它是一种思维形式的实体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. All right, so if he really is a Thought-form…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎么能消灭一种思想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the hell are we supposed to kill an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.98,0:28:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有这两个人在帮倒忙 我想这件事很不容易做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not gonna be easy with these guys helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.73,0:28:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看他们网站的更新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out their home page.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.90,0:28:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从他们上载了这段影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since they posted the video…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}网站的点击率在一天内增加了数倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}the number of hits have quadrupled in the last day alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.61,0:28:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我有主意了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.83,0:28:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们去哪儿？- 我们得找个复印店\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where we going? - We need to find a copy store.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我觉得我对刚才用的肥皂还是其他什么东西过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. I think l'm allergic to our soap or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.79,0:28:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你搞的鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.13,0:28:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你真是个可恶的混蛋 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a frigging jerk. - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.98,0:28:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.48,0:29:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不要想了 我不会回到那里去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, forget it.I'm not going back in there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.28,0:29:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈利你看着我 看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, look at me. Right here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个猎魔者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a ghost hunter. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 但我从没真正见过鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know but, Ed, I've never actually seen a real ghost before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.12,0:29:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真正的鬼可是会移形换影的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An apparition.This stuff here…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.95,0:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但就这一次冒险就能带给我们名望 金钱 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is our ticket to the big time.Fame, money, sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像女孩 好吧 勇敢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}With girls. Okay? Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.96,0:29:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了巴菲会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, W.W.B.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.80,0:29:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 巴菲会怎么做 - 巴菲会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would Buffy do? Huh? - What would Buffy do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.64,0:29:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她比我强壮多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but, Ed, she's stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.64,0:29:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.77,0:29:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁？快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?Come on out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.31,0:29:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有消息给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hear you in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.69,0:29:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.15,0:29:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.07,0:29:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有包装的动作明星 真是惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action figures in their original packaging.What a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 我们要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.28,0:29:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在正忙着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sorry, guys, we're a little bit busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.33,0:29:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很快就能说完 我们想要你们关掉网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll make it quick.We need you to shut down your website.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然 这两位昨晚受惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys get us busted last night.We spend the night in a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你们说出昨晚的经历 我可以给你们这个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to pee in front of people.And I get stage fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们为什么要相信你们？- 听着 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why should we trust you guys? - Look, guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都知道昨晚屋里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all know what we saw.What's in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.01,0:30:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而因为你们的网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to your website…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.59,0:30:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在成千上万的人都知道这个莫德凯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are thousands of people hearing about Mordechai.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就意味着 会不断有人跑去那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means people are gonna keep showing up at Hell House…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遇到Mordecai本人 会有人因此受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}running into him, could get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.68,0:30:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 也许他们说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Maybe he's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.31,0:30:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.02,0:30:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 不 我们有义务让公众知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we have an obligation to our fans, to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.23,0:30:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我没有义务让双方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an obligation to kick your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.32,0:30:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 算了 这些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Hey, just forget it, all right? These guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.57,0:30:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两个人只想自己干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could bitch-slap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使我告诉他们那些关于莫德凯的事情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could probably even tell them that thing about Mordechai.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.37,0:30:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们还是不会帮我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're still not gonna help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.91,0:30:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以我们还是走吧 - 你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's just go. - Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.87,0:30:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你怎么说 - 嗨 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd you say about…? - No. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.96,0:30:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 等一下 - 在这里等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait. - Hold on a second here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.75,0:30:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于莫德凯的什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What thing about Mordechai, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.76,0:30:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 - 不要告诉他们 如果他们愿意把网站关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't tell them. - If they agree to shut the website down…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不会的 你自己也说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not. Said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.34,0:30:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要听他的 我们会关掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait.Don't listen to him, okay? We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把网站关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.56,0:30:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是秘密萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a secret, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 这是个大新闻 很不容易搞到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it is a pretty big deal.And it wasn't easy to dig up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.11,0:31:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以除非你们保证会把一切都结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}So only if we have your word you'll shut everything down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.94,0:31:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.95,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是30年代的一份死亡证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a death certificate from the '30s.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.78,0:31:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们从图书馆得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.37,0:31:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据上面说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the coroner…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.75,0:31:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫德凯的真正死因是自制子弹的枪击\N{\fnArial\fs30}the actual cause of death was a self-inflicted gunshot wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.29,0:31:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 他没有上吊或砍死自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't hang or cut himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.92,0:31:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是吞枪自杀的？没错 用把。-45口径的手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot himself?Yep. With a.45 pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.75,0:31:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 直到今天他仍然害怕这种手枪 - 如果你用A45射杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They say he's terrified of them. - lf you shoot him with a.45…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 如果用把。-45口径的手枪 装上自制的熟铁子弹射击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}loaded with these special wrought-iron rounds…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.26,0:31:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能杀死这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd kill the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.27,0:31:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈利 慢点 周末有事做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry. Slow your roll, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们知道我们会很兴奋。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna know we're excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.16,0:31:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要是再拉一下那玩意儿 我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you pull that string one more time, I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了 老弟 你该多笑笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.You need more laughter in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.42,0:32:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直过于紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're way too tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们发表了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They post it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.72,0:32:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得到可靠消息 手枪能杀死莫德凯· 默多克\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We've learned from reputable sources…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.80,0:32:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错 我们要等多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Mordechai Murdock has a fatal fear of firearms."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.97,0:32:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到新的故事传开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How long do we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.31,0:32:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传说改变为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough for the new story to spread and the legend to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.94,0:32:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经想好晚上做什么了 爱尔兰的足球赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure by nightfall, iron rounds will work on the sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.94,0:32:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.33,0:32:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.48,0:33:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不骗你 我听到声音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.86,0:33:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那边传过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.32,0:33:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.82,0:33:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.25,0:33:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.33,0:33:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧你做的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.61,0:33:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我手上几乎都没皮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely have any skin left on my palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.40,0:33:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早知今日 何必当初\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aingt touching that line with a 10-foot pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.25,0:34:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得莫德凯在家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you think old Mordechai's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.59,0:34:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.22,0:34:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在干吗？找死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.93,0:34:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不过想拍一段预定了的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to get a book-and-movie deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.31,0:34:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.82,0:34:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 你们不想先进那扇门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, guys, you wanna…You wanna go open that door for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.53,0:34:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你不先进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.13,0:34:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他消失了 消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, he's gone. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.68,0:35:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你得到了吗？- 得到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get him? - Yeah, they got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.84,0:35:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说摄像机 你拍下来了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, on camera.Did you get him on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我看 - 让我看看 让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, l… - Let me see it. Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.11,0:35:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们有没有把我们给的文章发到网上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you post that B.S. story we gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.57,0:35:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 当然有 - 但后来服务器垮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Then our server crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.53,0:35:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这么说 - 等于没发咯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - So it didn't take?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.49,0:35:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以这些枪根本不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these These guns don't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.78,0:35:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.20,0:35:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Sam, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.79,0:35:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 有主意吗？- 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are getting out of here. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们离开这 来吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.63,0:35:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.80,0:35:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}母亲 玛丽和约瑟夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, Mary and Joseph…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝的力量使你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of Christ compels you…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.56,0:35:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哟 来抓我 你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it, you ugly son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.83,0:36:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开这 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.99,0:36:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.63,0:36:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.51,0:36:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.35,0:36:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 莫德凯不那离开房子 我们能够杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mordechai can't leave the house, we can't kill him…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.15,0:36:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样做应该行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.42,0:37:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}焚毁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.21,0:37:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想把这里夷为平地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the whole damn place to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.55,0:37:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样就没人会再进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will go in anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.38,0:37:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果房子不存在了 莫德凯也就不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Mordechai can't haunt a house if there's no house to haunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.93,0:37:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这虽然极端 但有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fast and dirty, but it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.64,0:37:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万一传说又改变了 让莫德凯能够离开房子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the legend changes and Mordechai is allowed to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.10,0:37:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们就得再回来一趟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we'll just have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes you wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在所有我们猎杀的东西里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the things we hunted…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有多少只是因为人们相信才存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many existed just because people believed in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫德凯一事确实物有所值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking that Mordechai has a really super-high attack bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我现在饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I got the munchies right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.19,0:38:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生们 - 嗨 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gentlemen. - Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.57,0:38:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她会报道吗？- 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should we tell them? - Eh, might as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.69,0:38:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还要再细读一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna read about it in the trades.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.86,0:38:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.53,0:38:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们收到好莱坞一个著名制片人的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got a phone call from an important Hollywood producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 打错了？- 当然不是 小哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah, wrong number? - No, smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.12,0:38:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在网上读到了所有关于鬼屋的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He read all about the Hell House on our website…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.71,0:38:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后问我们是否愿意参与他的制作团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wants to option the motion-picture rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.79,0:38:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会要我们写剧本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even have us write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.21,0:38:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 而且还会出RPG - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And create the RPG. - The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 角色扮演游戏 - 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Role-playing game. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.84,0:38:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种行话你们是不会懂的 所以 如果不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little lingo for you.Anywho, excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.18,0:38:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're off to La-La Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜你们了 听起来非常不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, congratulations.That sounds really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.52,0:38:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's awesome. Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.39,0:38:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 其实根本不关运气的事 是才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, luck. It's got nothing to do with it. It's about talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.69,0:38:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全是因为我们的才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sheer, unabashed talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.40,0:38:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.70,0:38:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望能再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.25,0:39:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我需要坦白一点 - 坦白什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a confession to make. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.42,0:39:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我打的电话还告诉他们我是制片人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who called them and told them I was a producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.35,0:39:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把死鱼扔在了他们的后车座上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who put the dead fish in their back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.56,0:39:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真相？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truce?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.27,0:39:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真相 至少在几百公里内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, truce.At least for the next hundred miles.
